From: cuongdesignnb <132921532+cuongdesignnb@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 09:13:30 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(admin): redesign product management UI

- redesign product catalog layout, filters and KPI cards
- add product detail previews for variants, fulfillment, media and SEO
- preserve existing catalog write contracts and currency boundaries
- improve responsive product management experience
